    "detailed_description": "In Konkwest your world domination campaign takes a single session. Take control of a country, and shape its history turn by turn. Plan its developments, its conquests, and its defenses. Make your plans simultaneously with all other countries and see them change the world.<br><br><strong>Simultaneous Turns around the World</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get rid of your flat map game, and accept the curve in Konkwest's globe view<br></li><li> Reject sequentialism, embrace simultaneous planning, don\u2019t wait endlessly for your turn</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/c823dfd771864aa7592efabcfb83f728.webp?t=1754493061\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2024 - Play (almost) any state in our modern world, even unrecognized ones<br></li><li> 2000 - That's over 20 years ago already, isn't that crazy?<br></li><li> 1900 - The buildup to WW1 belongs in any historical strategy map game<br></li><li> 1700 - Big Poland, big Sweden, big Ottoman Empire, what\u2019s not to love<br></li><li> 1300 - Experience the Holy Roman Empire at its height in a Medieval World<br></li><li> 0 (1BC) - Challenge the great ancient empires of Rome and China, or lead them to world domination<br></li><li> Balanced - A custom scenario where the world is divided up between equally sized countries<br></li><li> Kaiserzeit 1926 - A unique alternate history created for an unknown board game</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/d50d64aefb55e15c75a542176b1eaa16.webp?t=1754493061\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create your own country in any place, and give it a unique identity<br></li><li> Change its name, its color, and its policies to your liking<br></li><li> Add other countries to your world, and see them expand or fail</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/77828ad589131e3d66cd1af7ff46642b.webp?t=1754493061\" width=616 height=49 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with many other players in a single session <br></li><li> Connect with friends and others through the game's community</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In Konkwest your world domination campaign takes a single session. Take control of a country, and shape its history turn by turn. Plan its developments, its conquests, and its defenses. Make your plans simultaneously with all other countries and see them change the world.<br><br><strong>Simultaneous Turns around the World</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get rid of your flat map game, and accept the curve in Konkwest's globe view<br></li><li> Reject sequentialism, embrace simultaneous planning, don\u2019t wait endlessly for your turn</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/c823dfd771864aa7592efabcfb83f728.webp?t=1754493061\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2024 - Play (almost) any state in our modern world, even unrecognized ones<br></li><li> 2000 - That's over 20 years ago already, isn't that crazy?<br></li><li> 1900 - The buildup to WW1 belongs in any historical strategy map game<br></li><li> 1700 - Big Poland, big Sweden, big Ottoman Empire, what\u2019s not to love<br></li><li> 1300 - Experience the Holy Roman Empire at its height in a Medieval World<br></li><li> 0 (1BC) - Challenge the great ancient empires of Rome and China, or lead them to world domination<br></li><li> Balanced - A custom scenario where the world is divided up between equally sized countries<br></li><li> Kaiserzeit 1926 - A unique alternate history created for an unknown board game</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/d50d64aefb55e15c75a542176b1eaa16.webp?t=1754493061\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create your own country in any place, and give it a unique identity<br></li><li> Change its name, its color, and its policies to your liking<br></li><li> Add other countries to your world, and see them expand or fail</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/77828ad589131e3d66cd1af7ff46642b.webp?t=1754493061\" width=616 height=49 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with many other players in a single session <br></li><li> Connect with friends and others through the game's community</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The arcade grand strategy game. In Konkwest you and your friends can play through a world conquest campaign in an evening. Many historical starting scenarios bring you into the game world and let you lead your empire to glory. The single-resource economy makes the game accessible to all.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Arabic, Dutch, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America",
    "reviews": "\u201cStrategy that seems simple, but incorporates great possibilities and hours of play [...] The game feels truly integrated and complete.\u201d<br>7 \u2013 Somos Gaming<br>",
